// If tpmKey is not TPM_RH_NULL, then encryptedSalt is used in the computation
// of sessionKey.
//
// If tpmKey is not TPM_ALG_NULL, then encryptedSalt shall be a
// TPM2B_ENCRYPTED_SECRET of the proper type for tpmKey. The TPM shall return
// TPM_RC_HANDLE if the sensitive portion of tpmKey is not loaded.
